# convention (everything else is <100MB .7z). Regenerable deterministically
# from generate_randomized_simulated_frames.py + frame_manifest.csv + the
# original Test_21/*.mp4 source videos (random.seed(42)/np.random.seed(42)).
# The actual results this archive produced (raw_detections_simulated/,
# v2_fully_consistent_results.csv, the v2 figure) ARE committed.
